# Per-sha trainer snapshots are regenerated on every refit — ignore them so a refit
# never dirties the worktree or blocks a release. Patterns are relative to THIS dir
# (the previous `bench/ebm/energy-head.*.json` was mis-anchored and matched nothing).
energy-head.*.json
# ...but keep the live pointer the runtime reads, tracked.
!energy-head.latest.json
